# Agent scratch dir. Default: ignore everything, then allow back the few
# artifacts the project's memory depends on (see docs/STATE.md, "Docs map").
# Process noise stays out: per-task briefs/reports/reviews, review-*.diff
# (git already has those diffs), and ~150 verification screenshots.
*
!.gitignore

# The ledger — every task, review finding and deferred item, with SHAs.
!progress.md

# Decisions with their evidence.
!benchmark-palette.md
!tailscale-report.md
!tunnel-report.md

# The design contract the redesign milestones build against (v2 = current).
!redesign2-sessions.png
!redesign2-conversation.png
!redesign2-switcher.png
!redesign2-mockups.html
